<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-FOUR NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FOUR NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Four Nations</p>
<p>Cup friendly internationals played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Ghana 1 Kenya 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Nana Dartey (86th min)</p>
<p>South Africa 2 Australia 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: John Moshoeu (12th), Mark Williams (71st)</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,632</p>
</text>
